{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["בא בימים — and now the time had come to marry off his son in his lifetime." "And YHWH had blessed Avraham [with everything] — to make known what is set before us: that he did not send his servant to take a wife from his family on account of a shortage of women in the land of Canaan, that they would not want to join themselves to him, for he had been blessed with everything and the whole world desired to join themselves to him — but he wanted only from his family. This is what the servant said: וה׳ ברך את אדני מאד ויגדל — and therefore it was necessary to explain first: He had blessed Avraham with everything. Similarly: וחם הוא אבי כנען."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:44:52.655372032Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}